        prompt: "Write a letter to one of your friends to tell her/him about the holiday you are having. In your letter you should say:\n• Where you are going\n• Why you want to go there\n• The people you are going with\nYou should write at least 120 words. Your response will be evaluated in terms of Task fulfillment, Organization, Vocabulary and Grammar.",
        timeAllowed: 20,
