          b1: `Dear Sir/Madam,\nI am John Smith, from Chicago. I am writing this email to complain about the food and the service in your restaurant.\nYesterday, I went to your restaurant to eat dinner with my friends. We had fish, chicken, salad, and some vegetables. We had to wait for the food for about 45 minutes. We were hungry and tired. When the food was on the table, it was terrible. The fish was salty and the vegetables were dirty. What's more? The table and chairs were dirty. No one cleaned them before we sat down. In addition, the waiter was not polite when we complained. When we finished the meal, we looked at the bill. Oh, the food was too expensive. We were not happy at all.\nI would like to ask for the refund. I hope you can improve your restaurant more.\nI look forward to hearing from you. You can contact me at 0978687908 or via Johnsmith@gmail.com.\nThank you`
